pam-modules (217.100.6+ds2-2) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * Build-Depend on pietoolchain-host and pietoolchain-sdk.
  * pam_opendirectory refuses a password change with a password that is not
    valid UTF-8.
  * pam_sacl looks up the service access group without a trailing newline
    when the user has no UUID.
  * pam_group checks membership of a group that lists no members by name.

